"Save to “%@”…" = "儲存到「%@」…";
"Open Save Folder" = "打開儲存檔案夾";
"Launch at Login" = "登入時啟動";
"Check for Updates…" = "檢查更新…";
"Support ATA…" = "支持 ATA…";
