/* Main window */
"ATA keeps running in the background after you close this window. To open it again, open ATA from the Applications folder or use the ATA icon in the menu bar." = "關閉這個視窗後，ATA 會繼續在背景執行。要再次打開，請從「應用程式」檔案夾打開 ATA，或使用選單列中的 ATA 圖像。";
"No paired devices yet. Pair your Android phone to start receiving files." = "尚未配對任何裝置。配對你的 Android 手機後，就可以開始接收檔案。";
"Remove" = "移除";
"No recent files" = "沒有最近的檔案";
"Show in Finder" = "在 Finder 中顯示";
"Settings" = "設定";
"Change…" = "更改…";
"Open" = "打開";
"Save folder" = "儲存位置";
"Version %@" = "版本 %@";
"Remove “%@”?" = "要移除「%@」嗎？";
"The phone will have to be paired again before it can send files to this Mac." = "移除後，這支手機必須重新配對，才能再傳送檔案到這台 Mac。";

